 Hampshire County","/arc-plc/massachusetts/hampshire-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Hampshire County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 158% of normal in April to May and 65% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 53% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, with grid 26631 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
